# NOTE: models/ and outputs/ are intentionally COMMITTED this time (not
# gitignored) so the dashboard works immediately after cloning/deploying,
# with no manual .gitignore editing required. The dashboard also
# self-heals (trains+simulates automatically) if they're ever missing, so
# nothing breaks even if you delete them.
